<body>
    <h1>New Sku Database Requirements - Fortra Salesforce</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"149c08efca50" id=3D"NewSkuDatabaseRequirements-Fort=
raSalesforce-TablesNeeded:">
<style>[data-colorid=3Dpf6xa28ros]{color:#ff5630} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Dpf6xa28ros]{color:#cf2600}</style>Tables Needed:</h1>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"e7c3692363cc">
<li local-id=3D"7923772ff405">
<p local-id=3D"7491b0f885d2">All Fortra Products</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"696cdcaf0fa5">
<li local-id=3D"0c65a563b013">
<p local-id=3D"bb6cb406d148">Official Single Source of Truth for all Histor=
ical to New SKU mapping detail</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"38ce4580015a">
<p local-id=3D"182c84a11c26">Product Codes (Uses Hierarchy &amp; Rev Catego=
ry)</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4e96751a7ed8">
<li local-id=3D"ff73d30547ca">
<p local-id=3D"ca8631786ceb">Defines the New SKU Code with abbreviation</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1b14fba27538">
<li local-id=3D"b74bd0522fcf">
<p local-id=3D"f46be512c37a">Solution Category (abbreviation)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6bd9bfd85746">
<p local-id=3D"ed044797244a">Solution (abbreviation)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"17e64ec4096e">
<p local-id=3D"2a4b2b928da5">Rev Category (abbreviation)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4041f66ec1b8">
<p local-id=3D"4b0465158ce8">Product (abbreviation)</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e68d80a3c80">
<p local-id=3D"a365a5222b62">Workday Revenue Treatment Reference</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f4b172937b88">
<li local-id=3D"893897e75001">
<p local-id=3D"042d6cd580f7">Populates additional detail of Rev Category af=
ter =E2=80=9CRev Category=E2=80=9D is selected. + Revenue Category Name + R=
evenue Treatment + Revenue Schedule Template</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"880720a9cade">
<li local-id=3D"17e27e3da0b8">
<p local-id=3D"3b9f594e270d">The rules are different for Standard / License=
 / Maintenance SKUS (column BC) (Subscriptions)</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8cf2e21c396">
<p local-id=3D"8a71e31afdc2">Business Unit Mapping (May Help to have the en=
tire Hierarchy in Tables?)</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"6f5d90940cb9">
<li local-id=3D"826be43b40b0">
<p local-id=3D"ac5f4b436177">Workday Specific Field Need (Solution Category=
, Fortra Business Unit ID) Example: Email Security, BU49</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"521f5b69-cea4-4bf1-9edf-569899c8dda2">
<p local-id=3D"24b70a590b19">Hierarchy</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"0dd9a86a-2965-4758-8932-b44f0f8c2022">
<li local-id=3D"45d0d78c-a913-4a27-895c-24657276f2f0">
<p local-id=3D"28d2a5675a68">Unit</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e9e5841b-1a81-43cf-b34f-364c6db5b278">
<p local-id=3D"0d3dbee64a05">Solution Group</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"630749cc-bdaa-4817-90ff-c785cced4b3f">
<p local-id=3D"d784aacc00ce">Solution Category</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b7ff0d7-9342-4162-ad27-7ee75098595b">
<p local-id=3D"7b125180fd5f">Solution</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"134770cc8bf2"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"a328fabe3720" id=3D"NewSkuDatabaseRequirements-FortraSalesf=
orce-Rules/Requirements:">Rules / Requirements:</h1>
<p local-id=3D"aee1d07e8aa3"><strong>Duplicate Checks</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b34ba536e9ba">
<li local-id=3D"2d7262bef8b1">
<p local-id=3D"5c2ebfdda752">A New or Seperate SKU is needed if we do not h=
ave a sku that matches these three categories, we should be able to just us=
e attributes if the below three match. If one of the below is different a n=
ew Sku is needed.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"125a8bb9-ed42-4393-871a-9097a66944fa">
<li local-id=3D"3bcf5d5d-1265-4ce2-ada8-db62157867fb">
<p local-id=3D"83760c84536d">Final SKU name and license type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"738f96fd-b2bf-49a8-9397-15803dca4b58">
<p local-id=3D"4a29ab623d3a">Rev Category (From Finance)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac70361b-331e-42b9-9fef-90cae2505b83">
<p local-id=3D"fc8f4117a90a">Tax Code (From Tax Team)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"046371119267">
<p local-id=3D"0b4693ac7970">Can not have a duplicate Salesforce Product co=
de ID</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5412ab5e62ec">
<p local-id=3D"5b8bc471c079">Product Abriviation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"facf9a3979d9">
<p local-id=3D"f55bf261b3d2">Can not have a duplicate Final SKU + License_T=
ype Name</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"33c1c5f5c09f"><strong>When Multiple Skus Are Created - Based=
 on Rev Category</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d3c2b27274e8">
<li local-id=3D"74228209a015">
<p local-id=3D"82d4c904cd8b"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">This has been automated: (These _Lic and _Maint sku=E2=80=99s will on=
ly be utilized in Workday)</span><br>
Subscription SKU =3D Rev category RC_41202</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ab9560845853">
<li local-id=3D"1b254323c0c1">
<p local-id=3D"78c31c63ac36">We need 3 SKU=E2=80=99s for one Item (Subscrip=
tion) This was for previous SubSplit</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d4d70b10-25f7-4963-a8b3-be0a11e6d99b">
<p local-id=3D"633a7fb6393f">RC_41202 but not ending in LIC or MAINT =3D Tr=
ue =3D This sku would be the license portion of Workday bunble sku and reco=
gnized upfront.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8d887a1452f4">
<li local-id=3D"7dcd7a848615">
<p local-id=3D"a434821c2bad">A copy of the above sku with different suffix =
name, amount 30/60, and tax code is different</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ebe0a277f364">
<li local-id=3D"96a2c385bab7">
<p local-id=3D"35fda6d437ec"><em>LIC - Final Sku Name + License Type has _L=
IC at the end of the name (Salesforce Product Code is differet, Rev</em>Cat=
egory =3D RC_41202 Tax =3D DC010500 - software)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5d10b7b87d94">
<li local-id=3D"4b52e896a9a6">
<p local-id=3D"e7aec87888ea">Recenue Recognition Scheuled Tempate =3D Sprea=
d Even</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d2cb0041c3fa">
<p local-id=3D"f42e745fccc9">Non Quotable in Salesforce</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"f135428eeafc">
<p local-id=3D"19ed7714d2c6"><em>MAINT - Final Sku Name + License type has =
_MAINT at the end of name, (Salesforce Product Code is Differet, Rev_Catego=
ry =3D RC</em>43120 Tax =3D SC100222 - Maintenance =3D Spread Even</p>
<ul local-id=3D"777850ff5e0d">
<li local-id=3D"fb5ec12a9a37">
<p local-id=3D"a52b94fd7fbe">Non Quotable in Salesforce</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"5fdbec63eabe">
<p local-id=3D"3d336a9e2b02"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">This is manually maintained: (When adding a sku to database we have t=
o remember to add new and renewal maintenance)</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4cbfef9b7762">
<li local-id=3D"cd28b5957468">
<p local-id=3D"27e2b67aaf55">Perpetual SKU=3D Rev Category RC_41000</p>
<ul local-id=3D"41604cc05c90">
<li local-id=3D"71a514b44911">
<p local-id=3D"2c41f7c842af">Sku is Perpetual it must have 2 additional sku=
=E2=80=99s created identical except for these details call out below:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b86fb94916dc">
<li local-id=3D"cdd2bd003518">
<p local-id=3D"a4c7b4127348">New Maintenance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"635a2b4b5d4c">
<p local-id=3D"f8edb9cc93b5">Renewal Maintenance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"233043fa808c">
<p local-id=3D"7dccabc960e5">Fields in database differences below (All othe=
r fields should be identical to Parent):</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a1a06ca7e43">
<p local-id=3D"7dbcd54cb39a"></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
